#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course covers several approaches to matrix diagonalization using "
"quantum computers."
msgstr ""
"Saklaw ng kursong ito ang ilang paraan ng matrix diagonalization gamit ang "
"mga quantum computer."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-"
"algorithms/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-"
"algorithms/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course provides an overview of several approaches to quantum "
"diagonalization. Some background is provided on the classical methods that "
"are used, or that motivated the quantum algorithms. The content then steps "
"through the implementation of the quantum algorithms on real quantum "
"computers. There is substantial discussion of what factors determine the "
"scaling of approaches using classical and quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ang kursong ito ng pangkalahatang-tanaw sa ilang paraan ng "
"quantum diagonalization. May kasamang background sa mga klasikal na "
"pamamaraan na ginagamit, o na naging inspirasyon sa mga quantum algorithm. "
"Pagkatapos, itinuturo ng nilalaman kung paano ipapatupad ang mga quantum "
"algorithm sa tunay na mga quantum computer. May malawak na talakayan tungkol"
" sa mga salik na nagtatakda ng scaling ng mga paraan gamit ang klasikal at "
"quantum na mga algorithm.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Inirerekomendang background {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with "
"quantum computing and want to leverage its power in matrix "
"diagonalization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa mga indibidwal na may kaunting karanasan sa "
"quantum computing at gustong gamitin ang kapangyarihan nito sa matrix "
"diagonalization.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend that learners complete the following prerequisites prior to "
"this course:\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda naming kumpletuhin ng mga mag-aaral ang mga sumusunod na "
"prerequisites bago ang kursong ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get "
"started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang iyong lokal na kapaligiran sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa gabay "
"na [Get started](/guides/) sa aming pahina ng dokumentasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For deeper understanding of quantum information, try [Basics of Quantum "
"Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) with John "
"Watrous.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mas malalim na pag-unawa sa quantum information, subukan ang [Basics"
" of Quantum Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) "
"kasama si John Watrous.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
