#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Quantum diagonalization algorithms, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makuha ang iyong badge para sa Quantum diagonalization algorithms, "
"kumuha ng pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training. Nilalayong kunin ang pagsusulit "
"na ito pagkatapos basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Kapag naipasa mo na"
" ang pagsusulit, maabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakakuha ka ng badge.\n"

